Seems as you are in the first endgame level, the "earth" level. Four
other levels will follow.

IF you are well-prepared, you are carrying 4 scrolls of gold detection
and 4 potions of confusion. With theese things you can easyly find the
Magic Portals that take you to the next level. (In the earth level you
must dig your way.)

IF NOT... it will be hard... :-(


